  "limits": [
    "Native optional API only; the application NetworkSrf command remains unregistered pending Rhino fitting work.",
    "Two families of 2–32 open curves; degree at most 16, at most 128 controls per curve and 2048 total. Original complete curves must end at outer-family contacts; ambiguous contacts and overlaps reject.",
    "Shared importer weight/basis restrictions apply. Rational curves are approximated by the existing native polynomial producer. The working-frame approximation floor does not relax requested final image bounds.",
    "Prepared native curves limited to 2048 controls; conservative compatibility guard precedes tensor allocation and native transfer limits output to one million controls.",
    "Raw Gordon output may retain kinks. Smooth parameterization, C2 fitting, near-contact best fits, closed networks, poles, surface continuity, getter options and associative history remain NetworkSrf work.",
    "All returned native fixtures admit complete original input-image certificates within their edge/interior tolerances, and analytic query points agree within 1e-6. This does not qualify arbitrary interiors, symmetric boundary distance or injectivity.",
    "Rhino closest-point output and area comparisons fail on curved networks. All failed cases and full definitions are retained, with comparison status false. Closest-point output distances are not continuous geometric separation certificates.",
    "SDK area is measured on an owned translated duplicate after the remote-origin integrator failed; construction and world-space query outputs are unchanged.",
    "AddressSanitizer instruments SMLib, SM_API and adapter archives; Rust and separately bundled dependencies are not separately instrumented. Leak and optional stack-use-after-return checks are disabled.",
    "4 verifiable historical records preserve source hashes through immutable Git references; non-hash metadata stays unchanged. Pre-existing unverifiable records are untouched."
  ],
